Q("Retention depth matters because:", ["Storage is cheap", "Some disasters are discovered late — the fraud found at month four needs month-four-old copies", "Audits demand it", "Habits"], 1, "Retention linked to the reach-back horizons.", "Ch2"),
Q("The offsite copy exists because:", ["The host is doubted", "The firm's survival must not couple to one provider relationship's every possible future — the decoupling", "It is required", "It is free"], 1, "The difference between a hosting relationship and a hostage situation.", "Ch2"),
